    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Unyielding Purpose",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger Grachius would be reduced to 0 HP\n\nRequirements Grachius has a divine immolation spell remaining\n\n---\nEffect Grachius refuses to disappoint Abrogail Thrune; he stabilizes at 1 HP just long enough to cast divine immolation, centered on himself. He dies, immolated in the hellish flames."
